These files come unchanged from XZ Utils:

    Repository: https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz
    Path:       tests/files
    Commit:     3b1efb04d17c3a9ef7f473d73af13f1531428ffe

README is the upstream description of each file and of how a decoder has
to react to it. This copy holds only the .lzma files and the .xz files
that test LZMA2 itself. xz-utils_test.ts in the parent directory uses them.

XZ Utils' COPYING puts the test files in its 'tests' directory under the
BSD Zero Clause License (0BSD). tests/files/README says the same: "All the
test files and this README may be distributed under the terms of the BSD
Zero Clause License (0BSD)."

